{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dominion of Dracula</i>\u00a0is a dark fantasy roguelike where you play as Dracula himself. Rise from the dead to reclaim your castle. During your slumber, monsters have infested your domain and now is your time to take it back.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic turn-based roguelike with an emphasis on quick action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly generated levels so that no two playthroughs are the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique monsters with their own movement, attack patterns, and quirks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many fearsome bosses to slay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An intricate upgrade system to cast spells and grow stronger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable characters with unique abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pull of powerful combos with spells and skills.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3774520?t=1760721351","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3774520?t=1760721351","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774520/da2a2d360f25c7b85eaa5979993dd7b499465457/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760721351","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774520/da2a2d360f25c7b85eaa5979993dd7b499465457/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760721351","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dominion of Dracula</i>\u00a0is a dark fantasy roguelike where you play as Dracula himself. Rise from the dead to reclaim your castle. During your slumber, monsters have infested your domain and now is your time to take it back.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic turn-based roguelike with an emphasis on quick action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly generated levels so that no two playthroughs are the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique monsters with their own movement, attack patterns, and quirks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many fearsome bosses to slay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An intricate upgrade system to cast spells and grow stronger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable characters with unique abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pull of powerful combos with spells and skills.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Outer Engine Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774520/604c74412561e9e3a58c4dc12f19e297668db2ee/header.jpg?t=1760721351","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3774520/1570005335/1cf0dd30c9a7da5ceea873c775ab53c7006a54b6/1756178731/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760720095","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3774520/1570005335/1cf0dd30c9a7da5ceea873c775ab53c7006a54b6/1756178731/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760720095","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3774520/1570005335/1cf0dd30c9a7da5ceea873c775ab53c7006a54b6/1756178731/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760720095","id":257188918,"name":"Gameplay Preview Trailer 1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257188918/b3f558a34eb57c46bdc960a432dd569b550b45a7/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1760720095"}],"name":"Dominion of Dracula","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><l